### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

@productId = 41cee835-1c0c-4511-b091-246a213e8373
@imageId = 8f2a1c44-1c0c-4511-b091-246a213e8373
@secondImageId = 5b7d9e21-1c0c-4511-b091-246a213e8373


### ============================================================
### PRODUCT IMAGE ENDPOINTS  (F-03.06)
###
### A product's photographs — front, back, drape, fabric — one row
### per image, ordered. At most 8 per product, 5 MB each, JPEG /
### PNG / WebP only (checked by magic bytes, not by MIME type).
###
### The cover is position 0. There is no primary flag anywhere:
### "make this the cover" is a reorder.
### ============================================================


### ============================================================
### Upload one or more images  (the gallery editor's upload)
###
### multipart/form-data:
###   images   repeat the field for each file, up to 8
###   altText  optional, repeated positionally against the files
###
### Appended after whatever the product already has. Uploads are
### rolled back off Cloudinary if the registration fails, so a
### rejected request leaves nothing behind.
###
### Replace the file paths below with real images on your machine.
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/productImages/uploadProductImages/{{productId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/front.jpg
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="altText"

Front view, rani pink Chanderi
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="back.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/back.jpg
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="altText"

Back view, zari border
------Boundary--


### ============================================================
### Get a product's gallery  (detail + edit screens)
###
### Returns meta.count, meta.maxImages and meta.primaryImage.
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/productImages/getImagesByProduct/{{productId}}


### ============================================================
### Get every image, grouped by product  (admin list thumbnails)
###
### meta.galleries is keyed by product id, so the list renders a
### thumbnail per row without one request per product.
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/productImages/getAllProductImages?page=1&limit=500


### ============================================================
### Reorder the gallery  (drag order, and "make cover")
###
### Must list EVERY image the product has — a partial list is
### refused, because it would silently demote whatever was left
### out. The first id becomes the cover.
### ============================================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/productImages/reorderProductImages/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageIds": [
    "{{secondImageId}}",
    "{{imageId}}"
  ]
}


### ============================================================
### Set an image's alt text
###
### null clears it — the storefront then falls back to the
### product name.
### ============================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/productImages/updateProductImage/{{imageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "altText": "Fabric close-up, hand-block dhabu print"
}


### ============================================================
### Delete an image
###
### Removed from the database and from Cloudinary, and the gap in
### the ordering is closed — deleting the cover promotes the next
### image rather than leaving the product coverless.
### ============================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/productImages/deleteProductImage/{{imageId}}


### ============================================================
### Products carry their gallery  (no extra request needed)
###
### Every product read embeds `images` and `primaryImage`.
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/getProductById/{{productId}}


### ============================================================
### Validation: unknown product -> 404
###
### Checked before anything is uploaded, so a bad product id never
### costs a Cloudinary asset.
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/productImages/uploadProductImages/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/front.jpg
------Boundary--


### ============================================================
### Validation: reorder with a partial list -> 400
### ============================================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/productImages/reorderProductImages/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageIds": ["{{imageId}}"]
}


### ============================================================
### Validation: reorder naming an image on another product -> 400
### ============================================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/productImages/reorderProductImages/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageIds": [
    "{{imageId}}",
    "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111"
  ]
}


### ============================================================
### Validation: alt text over 200 characters -> 400
### ============================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/productImages/updateProductImage/{{imageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "altText": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}
